      "mode": "curated",
      "operator": "Helmut Schindlwick + Claude (AI pair-programmer)",
      "source_note": "Hand-curated from Microsoft documentation (retrieved 2026-08-06). Azure Local (formerly Azure Stack HCI) is customer-sited Arc-managed infrastructure. Two deployment modes are modelled as regions because they differ in service availability and sovereignty facts. Connected mode: Arc control plane (resource metadata, billing, telemetry, 30-day sync obligation) runs in Microsoft cloud under a US entity -- us_cloud_act and fisa_702 reflect management-plane exposure only, not workload data residency (learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-local/faq and .../concepts/telemetry-and-diagnostics-overview). Disconnected mode: only registration and licence-renewal handshakes remain per Microsoft FAQ; residual dependency on Microsoft as US-jurisdiction licensor is noted (computerweekly.com opinion 2026). residency_country is unset in both modes: workload data lives at the customer site and the catalogue cannot know the location. certifications: [] is deliberate -- no Azure Local-specific C5 or ISO attestation exists (verified absence 2026-08-06); CIS Benchmark and DISA STIG capable baselines appear as capabilities on the Security Baseline entry rather than certifications. L1 pricing: USD 10 per physical core per month (hyperconverged). L2: USD 20.1 (external SAN / disaggregated). L3 disconnected: negotiated only, no public list price. Sources: learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-local/ (overview, whats-new, disconnected-operations-overview, disconnected-operations-whats-new, billing, security-features, faq, system-requirements-23h2, manage/manage-bitlocker, concepts/telemetry-and-diagnostics-overview); azure.microsoft.com/pricing/details/azure-local/; learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-sovereign-clouds/private/overview/sovereign-private-cloud; dataon.io/azure-local-pricing-for-external-san-support-and-disconnect-operations/ (2026-06-25); learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-desktop/azure-local-overview."
    },
    "confidence": "medium",
